# Record the README demo with https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs
#   vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 620
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Type "fathom" Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "python app.py" Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "1" Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "git push" Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "1" Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "# find log files bigger than 100MB" Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "?" Enter
Sleep 4s
